node_modules/
*.log
verify-report.md

# A real instance profile is yours, not the repo's - keep the example, not the data.
instance-profile.md

# macOS metadata - never belongs in a repository
.DS_Store
._*
.!*!.DS_Store

# Structure captures: raw payloads are real instance data and must never be committed.
# capture/report.md is value-free and safe to share; the raw/ tree next to it is not.
capture/

# Build output. Produced by `npm run build` and again by `prepack`, so the published
# tarball always carries a fresh bundle while the repository keeps no artifacts.
dist/
